  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Lotion Highlighter Magic Party SPF 25</strong> — a combination of care, a radiant bronze finish, and sun protection.</p>\n<p>This shimmer body lotion is designed to enhance the skin's natural beauty, giving it a well-groomed look with a bronze shimmer and providing protection during sunny days.<br/>\r\nThe <strong>SPF 25 </strong>sun filter complex helps against the negative effects of ultraviolet rays, while its creamy texture distributes evenly over the body and absorbs quickly, leaving no stickiness or greasy residue.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/photo_5239968897396580206_y-1.jpg\" width=\"600\"/><br/>\n<strong>The formula is enriched with active ingredients</strong> that support comfort and hydration.<br/>\n<strong>Argan oil</strong> is known for its nourishing and softening properties and helps keep the skin smooth and elastic.<br/>\n<strong>D-panthenol </strong>promotes skin softening and supports its natural balance.<br/>\n<strong>Aloe vera extract</strong> helps to moisturize and maintain a fresh, well-groomed appearance of the skin.<br/>\n<strong>Food-grade glitters</strong> create a beautiful bronze shimmer that enhances your tan and adds a radiant glow.</p>\n<p>The lotion is perfect for the summer season, vacations, parties, or everyday use whenever you want to enhance your skin and add a striking radiance to it.</p>\n<p><strong>Product Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>bronze shimmering effect</li>\n<li>skin hydration and softening</li>\n<li>SPF 25</li>\n<li>lightweight texture without stickiness</li>\n<li>comfortable daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Lotion Highlighter Magic Party SPF 25 — a simple way to add a beautiful radiance, well-groomed look, and confidence to your skin every day.</strong></p>\n </div>\n</div>",
